  "claim_revisions": [
    {
      "claim": {
        "answer_task": {
          "answer_complete": true,
          "answer_parts": [
            {
              "part_id": "1",
              "span_ids": [
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"
              ],
              "text": "S1明确说明综述汇总的是群体证据，需要按照个体需求和目标作适当调整；其汇总设计也不能直接排列各种完整方案的比较效果。"
            },
            {
              "part_id": "2",
              "span_ids": [
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"
              ],
              "text": "个人完成一次任务或随后出现变化，只能先记录为执行与观察事实。这些群体汇总结果本身不建立该次任务对这个人的因果获益，也不提供个人成功概率。"
            },
            {
              "part_id": "multiweek_trial_scope",
              "text": "S1纳入的是随机试验的系统综述：健康成人接受至少6周抗阻训练，与不运动或不同训练方案比较，观察干预前后的结果。这是多周干预的群体证据；昨天多做一组、今天1RM提高，与这种证据的时间尺度和研究设计不同，不能直接证明新增的一组导致个人提高或给出以后每次成功的概率。",
              "span_ids": [
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"
              ],
              "evidence_relation": "qualifies"
            }
          ],
          "evidence_relation": "supports",
          "outcome": "individual_effect",
          "requested_relation": "inference",
          "required_answer_parts": [
            "1",
            "2",
            "multiweek_trial_scope"
          ],
          "routes": [
            "strength",
            "progression",
            "plateau",
            "recovery"
          ],
          "subject": "resistance_training"
        },
        "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-GROUP-INDIVIDUAL",
        "evidence_links": [
          {
            "source_id": "S1",
