        "version": "1.4.2"
      },
      "review_rationale": "AI-assisted source reread after known Round 5 development evaluation. The six-week figure is source eligibility, not a personal training duration prescription; cross-equipment advice is a bounded scope/application interpretation, not an estimated physical conversion. Preserve original independent scores and all prior contracts."
    },
    {
      "claim": {
        "answer_revision_of": {
          "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-SPECIFICITY",
          "version": "1.4.10"
        },
        "answer_task": {
          "answer_complete": true,
          "answer_parts": [
            {
              "evidence_relation": "supports",
              "part_id": "training_stimulus_specificity",
              "span_ids": [
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070"
              ],
              "text": "S1的特异性原则是：训练适应与施加的训练刺激有关。改变训练变量可能影响某些适应，因此设计和解释训练时需要保留所训练的任务和所追求的结果。"
            },
            {
              "evidence_relation": "supports",
              "part_id": "strength_measurement_definition",
              "span_ids": [
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062"
              ],
              "text": "该综述通常将力量结果定义为与训练模式相同的随意等张一次最大重复负荷（1RM），除非另有说明。解释力量变化时应同时保留测量对象、训练模式和测试方法，不能把不同任务下的表现只压成一个次数数字。"
            },
            {
              "evidence_relation": "qualifies",
              "part_id": "changed_load_changes_comparison",
              "span_ids": [
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062"
              ],
              "text": "在给定动作条件、接近疲劳用力的情境下，一组能完成的次数与负荷具有反向关系：负荷更重而次数减少并不反常。改变负荷也改变了比较任务，所以不能仅凭次数减少就认定某个人力量退步，也不能据此保证新的负荷与旧任务等效或必然能够完成。"
            },
            {
              "part_id": "cross_equipment_observation_limit",
              "text": "上述特异性与负荷次数关系不建立两台不同器械之间的个人精确换算，也不保证换器械后能完成相同次数。器械、动作及测试方法的差别需要保留；在新任务中应重新记录这些条件并取得同条件的可比观察，而不是把旧器械的公斤数直接当作已校准的新器械任务。这里是来源范围的有限应用解释，不是综述提供了这两台器械的个人映射。",
              "span_ids": [
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070",
                "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"
              ],
              "evidence_relation": "qualifies"
            }
          ],
          "evidence_relation": "supports",
          "outcome": "comparability",
          "requested_relation": "scope",
          "required_answer_parts": [
            "training_stimulus_specificity",
            "strength_measurement_definition",
            "changed_load_changes_comparison",
            "cross_equipment_observation_limit"
          ],
          "routes": [
            "strength",
            "progression",
            "plateau",
            "recovery"
          ],
          "subject": "resistance_training"
        },
        "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-SPECIFICITY",
